8. Term, breach and remedy

Free permissions continue while their conditions are met. Trial production
permission expires under section 4; a breach-notice period does not extend it.
For another material breach, rights granted here terminate if not cured within
30 days after written notice identifying it. Timely cure preserves permissions.
Separate commercial-agreement remedies govern that agreement. These remedies
do not terminate independent rights or authorize access to, remote disabling
of or destruction of Your systems/data. Attribution, prior rights, warranties
and liability provisions survive to the extent relevant. Mandatory statutory
rights remain unaffected.

